# Secrets. The Nansen key and, once the bot is connected, the Telegram bot token
# live in these. Neither ever belongs in the repo.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# Runtime state: players, bankrolls, bets, alert config (holds the Telegram token),
# the alert journal and the whale roster. Generated at run time, never committed.
# NOTE: this is `data/*`, not `data/*.json` — the journals are .jsonl and the older
# pattern would have committed every alert we ever sent.
data/*
!data/.gitkeep

# Local operator notes, not part of the app
